{"id":"leather-shirt","name":{"en":"Leather Shirt","ja":"なめし皮のシャツ","sc":"熟皮衬衫","tc":"熟皮襯衫"},"desc":{"en":"Leather shirts are tough and warm, but they have low elasticity, and get stuffy easily. Some explorers wear this as an added means of protection.","ja":"革製のシャツは丈夫で温かいが、伸縮性が低く、蒸れやすい。探検家たちの中には、身を守る足しにと着込む者もいる"},"level":9,"slots":1,"evalue":15,"fire":true,"earth":true,"kind":"Equipment","properties":[{"id":"hp-10","name":{"en":"HP +10","ja":"ＨＰ＋１０"},"desc":{"en":"Causes armor to increase maximum HP. Effect: Maximum HP increases by 10.","ja":"防具に最大ＨＰを上昇させる効果を付与する。効果：最大ＨＰが１０上昇する"}},{"id":"parameters-7","name":{"en":"Parameters +7%","ja":"パラメータ＋７％"},"desc":{"en":"Causes armor to enhance all stats. Effect: Increases value of base stats by 7％.","ja":"防具に能力を強化する効果を付与する。効果：素の能力値を７％上昇させる"}},{"id":"defense-10","name":{"en":"Defense +10","ja":"防御力＋１０"},"desc":{"en":"Causes armor to enhance defense. Effect: Increases defense by 10.","ja":"防具の防御力を強化する。効果：防御力が１０上昇する"}}],"categories":[{"id":"armor-clothes","name":{"en":"(Armor - Clothes)","ja":"（防具・服）"},"icon":"category-a-light-armor"},{"id":"pelt","name":{"en":"(Pelt)","ja":"（皮）"},"icon":"category-pelt"}],"ingredients":[{"category":{"id":"armor-clothes","name":{"en":"(Armor - Clothes)","ja":"（防具・服）"}}},{"item":{"id":"silkis-feather","name":{"en":"Silkis Feather","ja":"シルケスフェザー"}}},{"item":{"id":"leather","name":{"en":"Leather","ja":"なめし皮"}},"num":2},{"category":{"id":"oil","name":{"en":"(Oil)","ja":"（油）"}}}],"chars":["jurie","logy","homura","miruca","ayesha","solle","keithgriff","stera","kortes","wilbell","escha","lotte"],"stats":[{"hp":0,"mp":0,"atk":0,"defen":25,"spd":0}],"effectlines":[{"effects":[{"effect":{"id":"maximum-hp-20","name":{"en":"Maximum HP +20","ja":"ＨＰ最大値＋２０"},"desc":{"en":"Increases maximum HP value by 20.","ja":"最大ＨＰの値が２０上昇する"}},"number":1,"min_elem":30,"max_elem":49},{"effect":{"id":"maximum-mp-20","name":{"en":"Maximum MP +20","ja":"ＭＰ最大値＋２０"},"desc":{"en":"Increases maximum MP value by 20.","ja":"最大ＭＰの値が２０上昇する"}},"number":2,"min_elem":50,"max_elem":100}],"elem":"fire","hidden":false,"order":0},{"effects":[{"effect":{"id":"hp-regen-m","name":{"en":"HP Regen-M","ja":"ＨＰ再生付与・中"},"desc":{"en":"Regenerates HP on the target each turn. The effect lasts for 3 turns.","ja":"対象に行動時にＨＰが回復する効果を与える。効果は３回行動するまで持続する"}},"number":1,"min_elem":30,"max_elem":49},{"effect":{"id":"avoid-ko-s","name":{"en":"Avoid KO-S","ja":"戦闘不能回避・弱"},"desc":{"en":"Fixed chance when taking damage that would reduce HP to 0 that you will survive with 1 HP. The chance is low.","ja":"ダメージを受けてＨＰが０になるとき、一定の確率でＨＰ１で耐えることがある。発生確率は低い"}},"number":2,"min_elem":50,"max_elem":100}],"elem":"water","hidden":false,"order":1},{"effects":[{"effect":{"id":"speed-10","name":{"en":"Speed +10","ja":"素早さ＋１０"},"desc":{"en":"Increases speed by 10.","ja":"素早さの値が１０上昇する"}},"number":1,"min_elem":30,"max_elem":49},{"effect":{"id":"defense-10","name":{"en":"Defense +10","ja":"防御力＋１０"},"desc":{"en":"Increases defense by 10.","ja":"防御力の値が１０上昇する"}},"number":2,"min_elem":50,"max_elem":100}],"elem":"wind","hidden":false,"order":2},{"effects":[{"effect":{"id":"evade-attack-s","name":{"en":"Evade Attack-S","ja":"攻撃回避・弱"},"desc":{"en":"Increases evasion rate by 3％.","ja":"攻撃の回避率が３％上昇する"}},"number":1,"min_elem":30,"max_elem":49},{"effect":{"id":"dmg-cut-xs","name":{"en":"DMG Cut-XS","ja":"ダメージカット・微"},"desc":{"en":"Reduces damage taken by 3％.","ja":"ダメージの値を３％軽減する"}},"number":2,"min_elem":50,"max_elem":100}],"elem":"wind","hidden":false,"order":3}],"index":333,"enum":"ITEM_ARM_LEATHER_SHIRT"}